<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Início - Carro MVC</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #2c3e50; 
            color: #ecf0f1;
        }
        .navbar {
            background-color: #34495e;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        .navbar a {
            color: #ecf0f1;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            transition: background-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;
        }
        .navbar a:hover {
            background-color: #2980b9;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .main-content {
            padding: 50px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #9b59b6;
            font-size: 2.5em;
        }
        .stats {
            background-color: #34495e;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .stats p {
            font-size: 1.5em;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .stats-number {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #9b59b6;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #34495e;
            color: #ecf0f1;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 100%;
            box-shadow: 0 -2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="navbar">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/cadastro">Cadastrar Veículo</a>
        <a href="/veiculos">Lista de Veículos</a>
    </div>

    <div class="main-content">
        <h1>Bem-vindo ao Carro MVC</h1>

        <div class="stats">
            <p>Veículos cadastrados:</p>
            <span class="stats-number"><%= totalVeiculos %></span>
        </div>
        
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>Ana Laura Martins - MVC Carros &copy; 2025</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>